WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.775
Try it.

2
00:00:00.775 --> 00:00:03.438
Run the baseline checks
on the pilot collection.

3
00:00:03.438 --> 00:00:07.776
Both connector groups are in the
architecture record with two hosts,

4
00:00:07.776 --> 00:00:11.277
the forest is in the DNS
suffixes, the workspace is named,

5
00:00:11.277 --> 00:00:15.463
the export is complete, and the one
failure is the missing category.

6
00:00:15.463 --> 00:00:20.088
Then copy the collection, add one
space to one file, and try to read it.

7
00:00:20.088 --> 00:00:24.699
The read is refused: the licenses
file changed since its manifest.

8
00:00:24.699 --> 00:00:28.060
Every later chapter reads the
collection through that check.
